### Vytvor workera
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Peter Horák"}

### Vytvor druhého workera
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Jana Malá"}

### Vytvor task priradený prvému workerovi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Naprogramovať API", "worker": {"id": 1}, "priority": "HIGH"}

### Zmeň task na druhého workera
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Naprogramovať API", "worker": {"id": 2}}

### Over zmenu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1